To whom it may concern,

This document serves as a formal statement regarding my pending institutional proof of enrollment for my stay in Maastricht.

The purpose of my stay is a research internship to complete my Master's thesis. This academic project is officially backed by the European Erasmus+ program.

While the framework of my thesis and the internship agreement have been fully approved, the final institutional Erasmus+ contract and the corresponding registration confirmation are currently being processed by the university administration. Due to standard administrative processing times, the official certificate is expected to be issued shortly.

I will forward the official documentation to Maasland Relocation immediately upon receipt to complete my tenancy file.

In the meantime, full proofs of my financial capability and monthly funding are available and can be provided instantly upon request.